<title>HONG KONG: Champion interim net rises 24 percent.</title>
<headline>Champion interim net rises 24 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   8.8    vs  7.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.35   vs  1.30</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    139.48 vs  112.91</p>
<p>    Turnover		     571.87 vs  467.38</p>
<p>    Company name		 Champion Technology Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 25 to May 2</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 19</p>
<p>NOTE - Champion Technology is a telepaging group.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
